      "created_at": "2019-03-10T00:08:40Z",
      "updated_at": "2019-03-10T00:08:40Z",
      "body": "When running the builtin test suite with address sanitizer enabled, one of the ctypes tests causes a use after free demonstrating the danger of using a reference to the inside of a deallocated buffer. This use is detected as an error by the address sanitizer and can be replicated with the following; a stack trace from the resulting failure is attached.\r\n\r\nexport ASAN_OPTIONS=\"detect_leaks=0\"\r\nmake clean\r\n./configure --with-address-sanitizer --with-pydebug\r\nmake\r\n./python [Lib/ctypes/test/test_stringptr.py](https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/Lib/ctypes/test/test_stringptr.py) StringPtrTestCase -v",
      "author_association": "MANNEQUIN",
      "pin": null,
